      "side": 1,
      "message": "No, apex_info_list is filtered again after this according to the payload configuration.\n\nWhat to pass to a VM?\n- read apex info list from /apex/apex-info-list.xml\n- if prefer_staged: get staged apex info list from package_native, and override them\n- collect apexes according to the configuration from the list\n\nThis changes the second step.\n\nSharedlibs apexes are handled at step #3.",
