      "writtenOn": "2022-11-07T15:40:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes. it matters and it\u0027s what this CL fixes.\n\nPreviously, let\u0027s say we have two sharelibs apexes (apex-info-list.xml)\n\n- com.sharedlibs (is_factory: true, is_active: false, path: /system/apex/..., version: 1)\n- com.sharedlibs (is_factory: false, is_active: true, path: /data/apex/..., version: 2)\n\nNow with a staged one (version 3 at /staged/...), we\u0027d get after overriding\n\n- com.sharedlibs (is_factory: false, is_active: false, path: /staged/..., version: 3)\n- com.sharedlibs (is_factory: false, is_active: true, path: /staged/..., version: 3)\n\nAfter reboot, there\u0027d be two apexes.. in apex-info-list.xml\n\n- com.sharedlibs (is_factory: true, is_active: false, path: /system/apex/..., version: 1)\n- com.sharedlibs (is_factory: false, is_active: true, path: /data/apex/..., version: 3)\n\nSo, updating only if \"is_active: true\" matters.",
      "parentUuid": "f9a4dc4f_89477800",
